╭─ Webhooks ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── not set up ─╮
│ The webhook receiver is not set up. It lets a call of a secret address make qhost check a stack at once. A first     │
│ setup listens only on this host, on 127.0.0.1:8480; the address can be chosen before.                                │
╰───────────────────────────╔═ Webhook receiver ═══════════════════════════════════════════╗───────────────────────────╯
                            ║ ⚠ Set up the webhook receiver on 127.0.0.1:8480?             ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║ This creates the system user qhost-hook, its configuration   ║                            
                            ║ and the unit qhost-hook.service and starts it. It changes    ║                            
                            ║ nothing for the stacks.                                      ║                            
